-learned-from-watching-people?utm_source=%2Finbox&utm_medium=reader2">https://www.thefp.com/p/what-ive-learned-from-watching-people?utm_source=%2Finbox&utm_medium=reader2</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/culture-links-122026">Culture Links, 1/2/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.thefp.com/p/what-ive-learned-from-watching-people?utm_source=%2Finbox&amp;utm_medium=reader2</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.thefp.com/p/what-ive-learned-from-watching-people?utm_source=%2Finbox&amp;utm_medium=reader2</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 12:02:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[What I’ve Learned from Watching People Wait to Have Children]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Last week, I had to deliver terrible news that is sadly not unique in my line of work: I had to tell a pregnant woman that her baby had died in the womb…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.thefp.com/p/what-ive-learned-from-watching-people?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.thefp.com/p/what-ive-learned-from-watching-people?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/culture-links-122026">Culture Links, 1/2/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.thefp.com/p/what-ive-learned-from-watching-people?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.thefp.com/p/what-ive-learned-from-watching-people?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 12:02:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Explaining Behavior 14: Pure Sociology]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>This is part of a series on how to explain human behavior. It is based on a course developed by the late Donald Black at the University of Virginia. Parts 1 through 6 discussed the general logic of scientific theory. From Part 7 onward we cover different strategies or paradigms for developing explanations. The last installment was…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://jasonmanning.substack.com/p/explaining-behavior-14-pure-sociology?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://jasonmanning.substack.com/p/explaining-behavior-14-pure-sociology?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/culture-links-122026">Culture Links, 1/2/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://jasonmanning.substack.com/p/explaining-behavior-14-pure-sociology?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jasonmanning.substack.com/p/explaining-behavior-14-pure-sociology?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 12:02:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Christmas Eve In Starhill]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Welp, here we are on Christmas Eve, and I realized yesterday why this one is so tough for me: it’s the first Christmas I’ve had back here in Starhill since my ex-wife filed for divorce. No wonder! When I finish this newsletter, I’m going to meet a friend for coffee, then take my mother to lunch for her birth…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://roddreher.substack.com/p/christmas-eve-in-starhill?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://roddreher.substack.com/p/christmas-eve-in-starhill?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/culture-links-122026">Culture Links, 1/2/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://roddreher.substack.com/p/christmas-eve-in-starhill?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://roddreher.substack.com/p/christmas-eve-in-starhill?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 12:02:59 GMT</pubDate></item></ch